ing low on Aurora, so Kramer will have to collect batteries or use generators to recharge, as every action drains his power. Various power-ups collected along the way, such as jetpacks, energy spheres and temperature regulators, can help him on this crucial journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiny is about saving lives, so it contains no blood or violence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy non-violent, platforming action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 20 extensive levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your energy levels \u2013 the robots\u2019 source of life! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of cool power-ups found along the way. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496390/extras/501052c71674668f2494951190c82de0.avif?t=1760102589\" width=300 height=277 /></span></p>","developers":["Garage 227"],"dlc":[523820,523821],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496390/header.jpg?t=1760102589","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2016 Fulqrum Publishing Ltd. Developed by Garage 227 Studios, Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"metacritic":{"score":51,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/shiny?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/496390/65959/9c30935acfee86df68d079b49322cea416f8e75f/1751292940/dash_av1.mpd?t=1469631501","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/496390/65959/9c30935acfee86df68d079b49322cea416f8e75f